@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@mcpToken = 替换为创建时唯一展示的MCP令牌

### MCP 2025-11-25 初始化，不能使用网页登录令牌
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{mcpToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"initialize","params":{"protocolVersion":"2025-11-25","capabilities":{},"clientInfo":{"name":"dfkb-http-check","version":"1.0.0"}}}

### 初始化通知：202 空响应
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{mcpToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2025-11-25

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"notifications/initialized"}

### 只发现当前凭证允许的工具
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{mcpToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2025-11-25

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"method":"tools/list"}

### 检索分页与格式过滤
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{mcpToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2025-11-25

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":3,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"search","arguments":{"query":"沸点","mode":"HYBRID","pageNo":1,"pageSize":20,"formats":[1,5]}}}

### 只读 RAG：不创建或修改网页聊天会话
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{mcpToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2025-11-25

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":4,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"ask","arguments":{"question":"资料里的定义是什么？","selectedChunkIds":[100],"modelId":1}}}

### 分页列出当前有权知识库
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{mcpToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2025-11-25

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":5,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"list_knowledge_bases","arguments":{"pageNo":1,"pageSize":20}}}
